 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Document Automation, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is document automation?\", \"a\": \"Document automation is software that produces and handles documents from data and rules instead of by hand. A quick test for where it pays off: does someone still retype values that already exist in another system? The drafting half is also called document assembly.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you build an automated document workflow?\", \"a\": \"Pick one document, find where each of its values already lives, and decide who must see it before it leaves. Write those answers down as a paragraph. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a> builds the workflow from that paragraph, database included.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some examples of AI document automation?\", \"a\": \"AI is worth it for reading loan applications, bills of lading, and supplier forms into named fields: every sender lays the page out differently. On the outgoing side, a model drafts the summary paragraph of a monthly client report from the database behind it. NDAs and lease packets rarely need AI at all: a template and a request form cover them.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best document automation software?\", \"a\": \"For a law firm, one option is Gavel, which drives legal templates from a questionnaire without code. Teams already on Power Platform can use Microsoft's document automation toolkit in AI Builder for incoming files. Building your own makes sense when drafting and processing belong in one app, with the approval workflow attached.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is legal document automation?\", \"a\": \"Legal document automation drafts engagement letters and wills from a questionnaire and a set of clause rules. Under ABA Model Rule 1.5(b), a lawyer communicates the scope of representation and the fee basis, preferably in writing. Once drafted, an agreement usually passes through a contract approval workflow before anyone signs it.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is intelligent document automation?\", \"a\": \"Intelligent document automation uses large language models that can interpret a document they have never seen before, where older systems needed a fixed template for every layout. Emergent builds that reading step from a plain-English list of the fields you want. Judge a tool on last month's real files, and count how many fields a person had to correct.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is document processing automation the same as document generation?\", \"a\": \"No. Document processing automation takes files in and turns them into data by classifying each file and extracting its fields. Generation runs the other way, producing a finished document from data and a template. Many workflows chain the two: a signed application is read into fields, and those fields fill the approval letter. On Emergent, both halves share a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"What features should document automation tools have?\", \"a\": \"Conditional templates come first, so one master document covers every variant a client might need. For incoming files, the tool should read each upload into named fields and hold uncertain values for a person before they reach your records. Approval steps and a change history start to matter once several people edit the same drafts.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does automated document scanning do?\", \"a\": \"Automated document scanning reads each scanned image into text and named fields, the same way it reads a phone photo. Scan each document as its own file, because twenty invoices saved as one PDF leave the app guessing where each one ends. An app built on Emergent runs with no task cap, last year's backlog of scans included.\"}, {\"q\": \"How does document workflow automation handle approvals?\", \"a\": \"Approval is a step inside the workflow, placed after the draft is filled and before the file leaves. A rejection should return the draft to its author with the reason attached. Edits are the harder case: a changed price or clause should restart review, while a corrected typo can go straight out. Routing by role or amount belongs in a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/document-approval-workflow'>document approval workflow</a> of its own.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
